    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdlib.h.html\">stdlib.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nchar *getenv(const char *</tt><i>name</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_210_03\" id=\"tag_17_210_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]getenv[/I5]() function shall search the environment of the calling process (see XBD [A6][I7]8. Environment Variables[/I7][/A6]) for the environment variable [I8]name[/I8] if it exists and\nreturn a pointer to the value of the environment variable. If the specified environment variable cannot be found, a null pointer\nshall be returned. The application shall ensure that it does not modify the string pointed to by the [I9]getenv[/I9]() function,\n[S10][[A11]CX[/A11]][/S10] [IMG12]\n&nbsp;unless it is part of a modifiable object previously placed in the environment by assigning a new value to [I13]environ[/I13]\n\n[IMG14] [S15][[A16]XSI[/A16]][/S15]\n[IMG17] or by using [A18][I19]putenv[/I19]()[/A18]. [IMG20]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A6": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/V1_chap08.html#tag_08\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S10": {
